From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: djvalic <djvalic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:54:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ad5x: setup wizard filament step and live view translated
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The texts of the previous patch in en.yml and, with Russian values, in
ru.yml (52 keys, in one block at the end of each file), plus the log
name Ad5xFilament next to the other step names. Existing keys are
reused where the text is the same (Homing, Heating, Loading filament,
Nozzle, Bed, Slot {}, Empty, Done). The Russian uses the printer terms
of the other Kiln strings (печатающая головка, слот, филамент, смещение
по Z, лоток для отходов, образец). Other languages show English.
---
 translations/en.yml | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 translations/ru.yml | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 110 insertions(+)

diff --git a/translations/en.yml b/translations/en.yml
index 42b218bdcf..d88e17cd6c 100644
--- a/translations/en.yml
+++ b/translations/en.yml
@@ -6563,6 +6563,7 @@ translations:
   'Screen, sound, connection, and the printer''s own settings: Run Setup Wizard, Nozzle Size, Filament Auto-Refill, Plugins. Replay this tour from Help & About.': 'Screen, sound, connection, and the printer''s own settings: Run Setup Wizard, Nozzle Size, Filament Auto-Refill, Plugins. Replay this tour from Help & About.'
   ', corners {:+.3f} to {:+.3f}': ', corners {:+.3f} to {:+.3f}'
   ', not fully settled': ', not fully settled'
+  'Ad5xFilament': 'Ad5xFilament'
   'Ad5xFinish': 'Ad5xFinish'
